{'symbol': 'LMT', 'date': '2022-05-18 13:45:00', 'title': 'BUILT IN ARKANSAS: LMXT STRATEGIC TANKER BOOM REFUELING SYSTEM TO BE PRODUCED IN WESTERN ARKANSAS', 'text': 'OPPORTUNITY BRINGS HIGHLY SKILLED AEROSPACE MANUFACTURING WORK TO ARKANSAS BETHESDA, MD. , MAY 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LOCKHEED MARTIN (NYSE: LMT) AND AIRBUS LEADERS ANNOUNCED TODAY THE AERIAL REFUELING BOOM SYSTEM FOR THE LMXT STRATEGIC TANKER AIRCRAFT WILL BE MANUFACTURED BY AIRBUS IN\xa0WESTERN ARKANSAS.'}